        "original_id": "a5891a57-39de-5e29-ad0d-304780142b3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan McCafferty, Eddie Vedder\n- Bands: Nazareth, Pearl Jam\n- Works: Rock 'n' Roll Telephone, Water on the Road\n- Roles: lead singer, vocalist, musician, singer, songwriter, guitarist, frontman\n\nFacts:\n- Dan McCafferty was born on 14 October 1946 in Dunfermline, Scotland.\n- Dan McCafferty is a Scottish vocalist best known as the lead singer of Nazareth from the band’s founding in 1968 until his retirement from touring in 2013.\n- Eddie Vedder was born as Edward Louis Severson on December 23, 1964.\n- Eddie Vedder is an American musician, singer, and songwriter best known as a member of Pearl Jam, where he performs lead vocals and is one of three guitarists.\n- Rock 'n' Roll Telephone was the last Nazareth album with original singer Dan McCafferty, who left the group before the album’s release.\n- Water on the Road is a film released on DVD and Blu-ray by American singer and Pearl Jam frontman Eddie Vedder.",
